  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Shaikh Tousib Bilal vs The State Of Maharashtra And Another on 26 August, 2024 2024:Bhc-Aug:19287 1 46-ABA-1272-24.odt In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad Anticipatory Bail Application No. 1272 Of 2024 Shaikh Tousib Bilal Versus The State Of Maharashtra And Another ... Advocate for Applicant : Mr. Sartaj Khan H. Pathan App for Respondents : Ms. P. V. Diggikar ... Coram : S. G. Mehare, J. Date : 26-08-2024 Per Court :- 1. His antecedents of identical offences may not be a ground to refuse the abil.",
    "facts": "2. The applicant seeks pre-arrest bail in Crime No.I-177 of 2024 registered with Begumpura Police Station, Aurangabad, for the offences punishable under Sections 328, 272, 273, 188 of the Indian Penal Code and Sections 26(1), 26(2)(iv), 30(2)(a), 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. The police found scented Gutka in the vehicle. It was prohibited to transport and sell in the State of Maharashtra. Except this, there is no direct evidence against the applicant.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
